abstract: "Every valid target answer in the Absence Index release 2026-09 that names one of 70 vendors (5346 answers, captured under method v1.1 on 22 to 23 Sep 2026 for the Absence Index release 2026-09 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22907695)), read for factual statements about the vendor and classed true, wrong, stale or unverifiable against the vendor's own pages under the published Record rules. 2922 engine statements; every row carries its review state."
keywords: ["AI search", "B2B software", "Absence Index", "ChatGPT", "Claude", "Perplexity", "Google AI Overviews", "Google AI Mode"]
